{
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.ancient": "竟有亡者前来滋扰？",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.ancient": "我无暇理会。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.ancient": "亡者之怒……愚不可及。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-1r.ancient": "勿扰，前行吧，亡魂。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0r.ancient": "亡魂不会迎来死亡，我想。\n你究竟有何所求？",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0r.next": "轻语",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1r.char": "[sine]……走吧……[/sine]",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1r.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.ancient": "怪哉！竟是灵魂！特来扰我清静？\n我起誓！我从未踏入歧途！",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.next": "[静默]",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.char": "[sine]……[/sine]",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-2.ancient": "啊，正是这样！你欲择其一！\n任取你之所好便是！",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.ancient": "重返旧日游荡之地么，小鬼？\n或许此间某物，可助你了却那作祟之愿？",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.ancient": "此番专为你寻得些许阴邪之物，小鬼。\n看到这些雕纹了吗？",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]雕纹透散地狱业火。[/font_size=22][/i]",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-2.ancient": "或许……此物由你执掌更为妥当！\n我可不愿身染诅咒！\n你定当受纳！",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.ancient": "[sine]……苏醒吧……受缚者……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.next": "轻语",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.char": "[sine]……承诺……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-2.ancient": "[sine]……很好……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……受缚者……是时候……[jitter][red]燃烧[/red][/jitter]……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……再一次……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.next": "轻语",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1.char": "[sine]……[jitter][red]再一次[/red][/jitter]……[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-2.ancient": "[sine]……完成你的使命……封印就会解开……[/sine]",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.ancient": "一个发光的幽灵飘了进来。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.ancient": "像你这样的存在，也会需要我这些珍玩吗？",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-2.ancient": "不过……你身上倒是有一种[sine]光辉[/sine]。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-2.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-3.ancient": "而且，来访者，你甚至还没向主人问好……\n也罢。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.ancient": "璀璨的赠礼，献给耀眼的幽魂。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.ancient": "你还真是个有趣的家伙。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-0.next": "[静默]",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1.char": "[sine]……[/sine]",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-1.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.2-2.ancient": "怎么，还是一句话都不肯对我说吗，幽魂？\n看来，再美妙的珍玩也无法引起亡者的兴趣。\n可即便如此，想要登临高塔，你仍需要我的馈赠。",
    "OROBAS.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-0.ancient": "紫色的圆球，好温暖！绿色的光芒，好明亮！！朋友？？",
