    "OROBAS.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-1.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.0-2.ancient": "对对！朋友！现在我们就是朋友啦！！",
    "OROBAS.talk.HEXAGHOST-HEXAGHOST.1-0r.ancient": "亮闪闪的圆球回来了！亮晶晶的宝物给朋友！！",
